@startuml
title 大型重构里程碑
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #4F5D75
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #F5F5F5
  BorderColor #2D3142
  FontColor #2D3142
}
start
:M0 代码地图与依赖冻结;
:M1 接口 / Schema 与兼容策略;
:M2 旧实现与新实现并存;
:M3 数据或配置迁移;
:M4 测试、观测和回滚;
:M5 删除旧路径;
stop
@enduml
